// scripts/seed-new-collection.ts
//
// Seeds the local SQLite DB with the NEW ShafaQ Atelier product collection.
// Uses the images generated by scripts/generate-new-collection-images.ts
// (saved in public/images/products/new-collection/{slug}/).
//
// NON-DESTRUCTIVE:
//   - Deactivates ALL existing products (sets active = false) so the old
//     catalog disappears from the storefront. Does NOT delete any rows —
//     historical orders/reviews/wishlists referencing old product IDs remain
//     intact.
//   - Creates 10 NEW products with active = true via upsert (idempotent).
//   - Does NOT touch users, orders, OrderItems, reviews, colors, fabrics,
//     customization options, abaya styles, abaya images, store settings,
//     newsletter subscribers, gift cards, point transactions, or wishlists.
//
// Run with: bun run scripts/seed-new-collection.ts

